@display("std/js")
js: component(path = "std/js", lang = "heron") {
  | Foreign functions and [extension points](#language.interop.declaring.extension_point) implemented in JS or TS, and the generator that writes their TS types.
  |
  | Its surface is declared in `std/js/package.heron`, whose types the API reference renders.
  | `module` and `js` are specified in [Declaring foreign code](#language.interop.declaring), and `ts` in [Generated bindings](#language.interop.packaging.generated_bindings).

  uses = [language.std.types]
}
